:Script TcSaySize
:Synopsis Says the size of the item in the file list
:Description Says the size of the file or folder in focus in the Total Commander file list, as shown in the size column.
:Script TcSayPath
:Synopsis Says the path of the active panel
:Description Says the path of the active Total Commander panel. Pressed twice quickly, copies the path to the clipboard.

:Script TcSayDate
:Synopsis Says the date of the item in the file list
:Description Says the date and time of the file or folder in focus in the Total Commander file list, as shown in the date column.
